&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;The large circle is 5 inches in size and 3 inches in small. The inner circle of a large circle corresponds to the small one. The flamethrower gauge then has a length of slightly over 8 inches.
